    "body": "Iterating over a literal sequence whose items have different types, such as `(123, 123.45)` or `[True, 2]`, coerced all items to a common C type and changed the type or value of the loop variable.\r\n\r\nSee https://github.com/cython/cython/issues/8103\r\n",
    "closed_at": "2026-11-08T12:24:57Z",
    "comment_data": [
        {
            "_links": {
                "html": {
                    "href": "https://github.com/cython/cython/pull/8114#discussion_r4478829013"
