            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "Following up on my note in the ticket, this seems worth a separate PR to allow an independent decision about what change to apply to which legacy branches.",
            "commit_id": "9ba7db36bdd4c7046211de0ee6f251dcc4f7e47d",
